== Duty to indemnify for loss caused by fraud [Sec. 10] <10>

Fraudulent partner(s) must indemnify the firm for any loss caused such act in the conduct of the business of the firm.

#gfm.caution[
CMA study material doesn't shows a clear separation between section 9 and 10. Section 10 is shown as a part of section 9.
